# Elasticsearch / OpenSearch

Enforcement: **B**.

## Distinctives

- Mappings are critical; dynamic mapping surprises cause pain — define explicitly for production indexes.
- Near-real-time search: refresh interval vs durability/visibility trade-offs.
- Index lifecycle (rollover, hot-warm) for time-series logs/events.
- Queries can be expensive; page carefully; avoid deep pagination antipatterns.
- Keep authoritative business state in an OLTP store; search is a projection.

## Do not

- Treat search hits as transactional truth
- Change mappings incompatibly without reindex plan
